## --- PDF management ---
## By default, we ignore PDFs generated inside the practice folders
## to prevent compiled outputs from cluttering changes.
PRACTICA_*/*.pdf

## Do NOT ignore PDFs that have "PRACTICA_EN_LIBRO" in their name
!*PRACTICA_EN_LIBRO*.pdf
!**/PRACTICA_EN_LIBRO*.pdf

## If you want to commit specific PDFs, you can force add them with:
## git add -f PRACTICA_X/main.pdf
## Or comment out the line above if you wish to track all PDFs.
